From fa8d4d2b0df7a2ac90b7e8eaf2d563ec7579d899 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cliffhall <cliff@futurescale.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 01:24:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix: keep advisory draft-card titles opaque until publication

The prescribed `[GHSA-...] - <summary>` title put the private advisory's
summary on board #43, whose audience is wider than the advisory's, which
contradicted the skill's own "link and triage metadata only" rule. The
title is now the bare `[GHSA-...]` id until the advisory is published;
the summary is added just before the card is converted to an issue.

Refs #4870

Signed-off-by: cliffhall <cliff@futurescale.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .claude/skills/board-ops/SKILL.md         |  8 ++++----
 .claude/skills/security-advisory/SKILL.md | 22 ++++++++++++++--------
 AGENTS.md                                 |  6 ++++--
 3 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

